Project: Evershop Adult Products E-commerce (Errection.org)
Language: Czech (primary), English (secondary)
Framework: React, Node.js, PostgreSQL, Redis
Deployment: Docker-compose on Coolify

Specific Requirements:
- Adult products compliance (age verification)
- Gentleman's shop styling (sophisticated, humorous, bold)
- Multi-language support (Czech/English)
- SEO optimization for both languages
- Privacy-focused design
- Performance optimization
- Security-first approach

Code Standards:
- Use TypeScript interfaces for all data structures
- Implement proper error boundaries in React
- Use GraphQL for API queries
- Implement proper caching with Redis
- Use environment variables for all configuration
- Follow EverShop extension patterns
- Use proper database migrations
- Implement comprehensive testing
- Use semantic commit messages
- Follow accessibility guidelines (WCAG 2.1)
